==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|constituens}}, present participle of {{term|constituo||I establish}} < {{term|com-||together}} + {{term|statuo||I set, place, establish}}; see [[statute]] or [[statue]], and compare [[institute]] and [[restitute]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-uk-constituent.ogg|Audio (UK)}}
{{wikipedia}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# being a [[part]], or [[component]] of a [[whole]]
# [[authorized]] to make a [[constitution]]

